      * IMERP - Error Message Description File
      *=========================================================================
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R PER01                     TEXT('Error Message Desc File')

     A            ERCODE         8          COLHDG('ERROR CODE')
     A            ERMSG         80          COLHDG('ERROR MESSAGE')
     A            ERCAT         10          COLHDG('Error Category')
     A            ERSCAT        10          COLHDG('Error Sub-Category')

      * LAST MAINT INFO
     A            ERIUSR        10          COLHDG('INIT USER')
     A            ERIPGM        10          COLHDG('INIT PGM')
     A            ERITIM          Z         COLHDG('INIT TIMESTAMP')
     A            ERLUSR        10          COLHDG('USER LAST MAINT')
     A            ERLPGM        10          COLHDG('LAST MAINT PGM')
     A            ERLTIM          Z         COLHDG('LAST MAINT TIME')

     A          K ERCODE
